  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&nbsp;MeV</mo></math>&nbsp;energy&nbsp;is released in the fission of a single nucleus of <math><msub><mrow><mi>&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>92</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>235</mn></mrow></msup></math>. How many fissions must occur per second to produce a power of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>kW</mi></math>?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>3.125</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>6.250</mn><mo>×</mo><mi> </mi><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>1.525</mn><mi> </mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "None of these",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "We know that 1 kW <math><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Also, <math><mn>1.6</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mn>200</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>200</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>1.6</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math><br /><br />Number of fissions = <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />= <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>200</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>1.6</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>3.125</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
  }
}